# Image and Graphic Interpretation

This component investigates limitations of Large Language Models (LLMs) in interpreting complex graphics and diagrams.

Different LLMs were tested to compare their performance in extracting information from graphical supply chain documentation. An additional approach was evaluated in which graphics were divided into smaller sections to improve interpretation accuracy.

This folder includes:
- The original document used for testing (Supply Chain Map)
- LLM-generated outputs from different models
- An analysis comparing the results and assessing output accuracy
